# Trusted corpus pin-index decoder

Import AlejandroIdentity from "./alejandro_identity.lg".
Import AlejandroJsonFields from "./alejandro_json_fields.lg".
Import AlejandroProvenance from "./alejandro_provenance.lg".

## To decodeAlejandroPins (raw: Text, caseId: Text) -> Result of AlejandroPins and Text:
    If alejandroCaseIdAccepted(caseId) is equal to false:
        Return a new Err with error "invalid requested original case id".
    If length of text_bytes(raw) is greater than 16777216:
        Return a new Err with error "pin index exceeds admission limit".
    Let approved be "22b26a3fc2da87d04c8863767896beb3f18780e42a304863c5718cb270d1cf32".
    If alejandroRawMatches(raw, approved) is equal to false:
        Return a new Err with error "unapproved corpus pin index".
    Inspect alejandroStrictObject(raw):
        When Err (failure):
            Return a new Err with error failure.
        When Ok (index):
            Inspect jsonNoExtraKeys(index, ["schema", "sourceHost", "sourceRoot", "pins"]):
                When Err (failure):
                    Return a new Err with error failure.
            Inspect alejandroArrayField(index, "pins"):
                When Err (failure):
                    Return a new Err with error failure.
                When Ok (rows):
                    If length of rows is not equal to 248:
                        Return a new Err with error "original pin inventory is incomplete".
                    Repeat for row in rows:
                        Inspect decodeAlejandroPinRow(row):
                            When Err (failure):
                                Return a new Err with error failure.
                            When Ok (pins):
                                If pins's caseId is equal to caseId:
                                    Return a new Ok with value pins.
    Return a new Err with error "requested case is absent from approved pins".
## To decodeAlejandroPinRow (row: Json) -> Result of AlejandroPins and Text:
    Let keys be ["caseId", "sourcePath", "archiveDigest", "manifestDigest", "sourceDigest", "ledgerDigest"].
    Inspect alejandroTextFields(row, keys, [], []):
        When Ok (values):
            Let caseId be item 1 of values.
            Let path be item 2 of values.
            Let archive be item 3 of values.
            Let sourceEnvelope be item 4 of values.
            Let source be item 5 of values.
            Let ledger be item 6 of values.
            Let pins be a new AlejandroPins with caseId caseId and sourcePath path and archiveDigest archive and manifestDigest sourceEnvelope and sourceDigest source and ledgerDigest ledger.
            If alejandroOriginalPinsAccepted(pins) is equal to false or alejandroSourcePathAccepted(path, caseId) is equal to false:
                Return a new Err with error "invalid original pin row".
            Return a new Ok with value pins.
        When Err (failure):
            Return a new Err with error failure.
    Return a new Err with error "invalid source pin record".
